    "sentence_translations": [
      "Who Are You?",
      "",
      "Someone came. She saw me, and was very happy!",
      "",
      "“You can walk; that’s great!” she said.",
      "",
      "“Who are you?” I asked her.",
      "",
      "“I have a lot of fruit. Do you eat fruit?”",
      "",
      "“Who are you?”",
      "",
      "“Do you eat apples? Wait, no, can cats eat fruit?”",
      "",
      "“I’m asking you! Who are you?”",
      "",
      "“The apples are here. Do you want any?”",
      "",
      "“Who! Are! You!”",
      "",
      "“What? Are you saying that you don’t want any? Can cats not eat fruit?”",
      "",
      "“Who are you?” She doesn’t know that I’m asking her? She doesn’t know what I am saying?",
      "",
      "“You …. are you saying that you can’t eat apples? No worries, I have rice. Do you want some?”",
      "",
      "Rice! I like eating rice! I’ll stop asking her. I want to eat rice!",
      "",
      "She saw that I was eating the rice, and she smiled!",
      "",
      "“It’s delicious!” I said. I kind of liked her now.",
      ""
